# Context & Instructions for Cursor
Please read and strictly follow AGENTS.md and docs/design-system.md located in this project.

Key rules:
- Role: Only 1 role: Student (student). Do NOT build an admin panel or multi-role system.
- Routing: Use the existing router in `src/router.jsx` and `src/App.jsx`. DO NOT install or import `react-router-dom`.
- API: ALL HTTP requests MUST go through `src/lib/api.js`. DO NOT call `fetch()` directly in UI components.
- Design: SquareUp Figma Dark Theme (dark background `#1a1a1a`, structural borders `#262626`, neon lime CTA `#9eff00`, Barlow + Inter fonts, `.sq-*` classes, assets in `public/figma/`).
- Database: SQLite via `better-sqlite3` in `server/db.js`. Express on port 3001 in `server/index.js`.
- Always verify with `npm run build` before completing work.
